ight">→</button></div></div></div><footer>Built for Nigerian schools. Designed around people. ';xp_clock();echo '</footer></section><main class="xp-account" id="account-form"><nav><a href="?login=1">Sign in</a><a href="?register=1">Create a school</a><a href="?join=1">Join a school</a><button type="button" data-xp-theme aria-label="Switch colour theme">◐ Theme</button></nav><div class="xp-account-inner"><span class="xp-eyebrow">'.($school?'YOUR NEXT CHAPTER':($join?'WELCOME TO YOUR COMMUNITY':'YOUR SCHOOL WORKSPACE')).'</span><h2>'.($school?'Let your school thrive.':($join?'Find your place.':'Good to see you again.')).'</h2><p class="xp-muted">'.($school?'Create your school, choose a subscription and follow your guided setup.':($join?'Request access to your school. Its administrator will verify your identity and email, approve your role and issue a temporary credential. You choose a new password at first sign-in.':'Your classes, people and priorities, together in one place.')).'</p>';
